  <History Date="02-04-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very poor documentation -  looks incomplete and isn't really suitable to create a personality.  channels only.  note advanced mode layer 2 has 2x red.  It is not clear what this is.  Defined as 16bit for now but it looks wrong)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="29-07-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest documentation in response to manufacturer request.  What a mess.  Added Atlabase IDs." Version="3" />
